abstract: >-
  A governed Node.js web acquisition layer for AI agents with explicit network,
  browser, provider, extraction, resource, and evidence boundaries. Version
  0.7.0 promotes the reviewed package API without changing the runtime,
  dependency graph, or frozen evidence shipped in 0.7.0-rc.1. The preferred
  citation remains the historical RC paper and does not certify the stable
  software release.
